    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CUBAN RADIONOVELA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Cuban radionovela 'El derecho de nacer' is the original source material for both the 1952 film and the 1981 TV series."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0231-63a1975a556a</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEXICO&quot;">
